@gcu/lzma is a port to JavaScript of parts of liblzma 5.8.1 (XZ Utils), by
Lasse Collin, Igor Pavlov and the other XZ Utils authors — the LZ encoder and
its match finders, the LZMA / LZMA2 encoders and decoders, the .xz / .lzma
containers, and the delta and branch filters. liblzma is under the BSD Zero
Clause License (0BSD), which asks nothing of derived works; this notice
records where the code comes from.
